<div class="reading"><span class="section-number">04 · Looking at the actual game</span><h2>The later consumer gets its power back</h2><p>With the candidate, energy leaves the cube and reaches the later Just Dire Things consumer. These separately captured views show the frozen result after the same controlled second transfer pass: the source has supplied energy, and the consumer is full.</p></div>
