<section class="reading" id="validation">
<span class="section-number">05 · Checking the change</span><h2>The regression fails before the fix—and passes after it</h2>
<p>The dedicated-server comparison runs the same eight selected test sources against the baseline and the candidate. Five regression cases fail as expected on 4.34, while three controls pass. All eight pass with the candidate. The controls include visiting the healthy consumer first and respecting retention limits.</p>
<div class="results"><div class="result baseline"><small>SFM 4.34 baseline</small><b>5 fail · 3 pass</b><span>The intended regression failures appear; controls remain healthy.</span></div><div class="result fixed"><small>SFM 4.35 candidate</small><b>8 pass</b><span>The same selected tests complete successfully.</span></div></div>
<p>The GUI comparison is a separate harness around the dropper-first case. Both final before/after runs completed the real puppet interaction and evidence export successfully. The other seven server cases have no GUI acceptance claim. Earlier failed preparation and export attempts remain in the historical appendix, separate from these final results.</p>
